Description: file manager based on KDE Dolphin
 Orcinus is a file manager for KDE Plasma and other desktops, based on KDE
 Dolphin. It adds, among other things, multiple toolbars, linked and locked
 split views, view styles, expandable Compact view with colored subtrees, and
 a built-in image and video viewer coupled to the selection.
 .
 Orcinus is installed next to Dolphin and does not share configuration with
 it; installing it does not change the default file manager.
 .
 This is an alpha release.
